{"step_index":439,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:38:53Z","content":"Here are the step-by-step commands to re-run **CodeDuel**:\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Restart Backend (Spring Boot)\n\nIn your **PowerShell Terminal 1**:\n\n1. Press **`Ctrl + C`** (and type `Y` if prompted) to stop the current backend server.\n2. Run:\n   ```powershell\n   cd C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\backend\n   mvn spring-boot:run\n   ```\n3. Wait until you see:\n   ```text\n   Started CodeDuelApplication in ... seconds\n   Successfully seeded 1100 total DSA problems into CodeDuel bank!\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Start Frontend (React + Vite)\n\nOpen a **second PowerShell Terminal 2** and run:\n\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\frontend\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nYou will see:\n```text\n  VITE v5.4.21  ready in ... ms\n\n  ➜  Local:   http://localhost:5173/\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Open in Browser\n\n1. Open your browser and go to:\n   👉 **[`http://localhost:5173/`](http://localhost:5173/)**\n2. Sign in using any demo account (e.g. **`anshu`** / `password123` or **`rahul`** / `password123`).\n3. Click **`Practice`** or **`Find Match`** and click **`Run Code`** or **`Submit Solution`** (`Ctrl + Enter`). Test cases will now execute and pass!"}
